build/

# Phase 3a storage corpus: the sample files (.log / .codex / defunct .txt) are
# GENERATED TEST DATA, not source -- same call as the rsl-wire fuzz corpus. They
# are regenerated by `golden-gen --storage` and pinned by the `fp64` (Rabin-64
# of the whole file) that corpus/storage/MANIFEST.json records for every sample.
# MANIFEST.json itself IS committed: it is the ground truth (executed recovery
# outcomes + per-file hashes), it is small and text, and diffing it in CI proves
# every regenerated file is byte-identical to what was recorded.
corpus/storage/*.log
corpus/storage/*.codex
corpus/storage/defunct-*.txt
!corpus/storage/MANIFEST.json
